xplore Lyon Submit a Deposit We can't wait to meet you Schedule a visit Apply Today We are thrilled that you've decided to come to Lyon College! Your $250 deposit guarantees a place in next year's class. You can send us your deposit by following the steps below! Deposit Online* To secure your spot at Lyon, complete these steps in your admissions portal : Log in to the Lyon College Admissions Portal Click \"Deposit Now\" Accept your admissions offer Pay your enrollment deposit Go to My Admissions Portal Need help logging in or forgot your credentials? Email admissions@lyon.edu or call 870-307-7250. Our Enrollment Services team is happy to help! *You must be accepted to Lyon before you can place your deposit. If you have not yet been accepted, apply here and send your transcript. Lyon College Start Your Future Lyon is more than just a college. It's a community distinguished by its academic curriculum, unique honor and social systems, and award-winning professors. Apply Today Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar tik-tok-icon-black 2300 Highland Road • Batesville, Arkansas 72501 • Phone: (870) 307-7000 • Fax: (870) 307-7001 2026 © Speak Creative. All rights reserved. Sitemap | Privacy Policy |"
