 The Lyon College Center for Career and Professional Development is committed to empowering every Lyon student to build the academic, experiential, and work skills to lead rewarding lives and careers. We do this by providing Lyon students with: Career Coaching to help every student with the challenging decisions about what is the right major and career path for them. Career management course that will provide a comprehensive review on how to effectively manage your career and life. Tools such as resume, cover letter, and CV templates Events such as career fairs, employer visits, and guest lecturers. Assessment tools to help you gain insights on what majors and careers will interest you. Resources that will provide every student with timely information on current career trends. It All Starts Here Whether you are a first-year student who is undeclared or a senior with a well-defined career plan, the Center for Career and Professional Development can help you! Career Planning Job Search Tools Opportunities Career Readiness Resume and Cover Letters Handshake Finding a Major Job Search Strategies Student Employment Finding a Career Interviewing Internships Assessments Networking Micro-internships Career Course Mentoring Study Abroad Career Planning Career Planning Job Search Tools Job Search Tools Opportunities ] Career Pathways Podcast Opportunities Lyon College Start Your Future Lyon is more than just a college. It's a community distinguished by its academic curriculum, unique honor and social systems, and award-winning professors. Apply Today Contact Resources Contact Us Event Request Application Give Job Opportunities Marketing Request News Report a Concern Footer Right Nav Course & Exam Schedules Stay Connected Style Guide Net Price Calculator The Highlander Newspaper Community Calendar tik-tok-icon-black 2300 Highland Road • Batesville, Arkansas 72501 • Phone: (870) 307-7000 • Fax: (870) 307-7001 2026 © Speak Creative. All rights reserved. Sitemap | Privacy Policy 